        <p source="#source-6777-6831"><seg source="#source-6777-6801">（十五・十・十一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-6801-6828"><rb>鵠沼</rb><rt>くげぬま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-6828-6831">）</seg></p>
